{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_18", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_18.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "But you are going to print it?", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "I cannot very well refuse a distinguished man.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "I have nothing to do with editing the paper, Mr. Mayor\u2014", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "I understand.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "I merely print what is put into my hands.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Quite so.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "And so I must\u2014 (moves off towards the printing-room).", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "No, but wait a moment, Mr. Aslaksen.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "You will allow me, Mr. Hovstad?", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "If you please, Mr. Mayor.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "You are a discreet and thoughtful man, Mr. Aslaksen.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "I am delighted to hear you think so, sir.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "And a man of very considerable influence.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Chiefly among the small tradesmen, sir.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "The small tax-payers are the majority\u2014here as everywhere else.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "That is true.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "And I have no doubt you know the general trend of opinion among them, don't you?", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes I think I may say I do, Mr. Mayor.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes.", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, since there is such a praiseworthy spirit of self-sacrifice among the less wealthy citizens of our town\u2014", "para": 17, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "What?", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Self-sacrifice?", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "It is pleasing evidence of a public-spirited feeling, extremely pleasing evidence.", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "I might almost say I hardly expected it.", "para": 20, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "But you have a closer knowledge of public opinion than I.", "para": 20, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "But, Mr. Mayor\u2014", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "And indeed it is no small sacrifice that the town is going to make.", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "The town?", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "But I don't understand.", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Is it the Baths\u2014?", "para": 24, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "At a provisional estimate, the alterations that the Medical Officer asserts to be desirable will cost somewhere about twenty thousand pounds.", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "That is a lot of money, but\u2014", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "Of course it will be necessary to raise a municipal loan.", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (getting up).", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Surely you never mean that the town must pay\u2014?", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you mean that it must come out of the municipal funds?\u2014out of the ill-filled pockets of the small tradesmen?", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, my dear Mr. Aslaksen, where else is the money to come from?", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "The gentlemen who own the Baths ought to provide that.", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "The proprietors of the Baths are not in a position to incur any further expense.", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "Is that absolutely certain, Mr. Mayor?", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "I have satisfied myself that it is so.", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "If the town wants these very extensive alterations, it will have to pay for them.", "para": 34, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "But, damn it all\u2014I beg your pardon\u2014this is quite another matter, Mr. Hovstad!", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "It is, indeed.", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "The most fatal part of it is that we shall be obliged to shut the Baths for a couple of years.", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Shut them?", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "Shut them altogether?", "para": 38, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "For two years?", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, the work will take as long as that\u2014at least.", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "I'm damned if we will stand that, Mr. Mayor!", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "What are we householders to live upon in the meantime?", "para": 41, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Unfortunately, that is an extremely difficult question to answer, Mr. Aslaksen.", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "But what would you have us do?", "para": 42, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you suppose we shall have a single visitor in the town, if we go about proclaiming that our water is polluted, that we are living over a plague spot, that the entire town\u2014", "para": 42, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "And the whole thing is merely imagination?", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "With the best will in the world, I have not been able to come to any other conclusion.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}]}